				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "This page describes how to create views that work both locally and remotely in Glamorous Toolkit."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-07-27T22:57:18.179+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-28T10:44:27.677539+03:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "k/zJHAgG5kOhslOFdu+aNQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : " These views subclass {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowLocalView}} and participate in both the local inspector rendering and the remote declarative view pipeline."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-28T10:44:41.61849+03:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-28T10:44:41.61849+03:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "dLVAyieIRa6KtYaAGs75zA=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "A local/remote view consists of several collaborating classes:"
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-28T10:44:44.343969+03:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-28T10:47:11.391506+03:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "FoM9PThETQSjjvwyXj+9Tw=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "1. **View** (subclass of {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowLocalView}}) — the view definition created by {{gtPragma:gtView}} methods. Holds computation blocks for producing the view's data."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-28T10:44:45.994351+03:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-28T10:44:45.994351+03:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "aDhEBNdoTRO1TjjJdlqbcQ=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "2. **Specification** (subclass of {{gtClass:GtPhlowViewSpecification}}) — a serializable description of the view that can cross process boundaries. Knows how to serialize/deserialize itself and how to create a local rendering element."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-28T10:44:48.080276+03:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-28T10:44:48.080276+03:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "ZSvFDsI7QGu/FBumubs7Aw=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "3. **Data Source** (subclass of {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowDeclarativeViewDataSource}}) — evaluates the view's computation blocks and produces view data. Wraps errors into {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowViewErrorData}}."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-28T10:44:49.257203+03:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-28T10:44:49.257203+03:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "VD9MXtFsQ622Zwr0FItPMQ=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "4. **View Data** (subclass of {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowBasicViewData}}) — a value object carrying the computed data (e.g., bytes, dimensions). Serializes to/from dictionaries for transport."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-07-27T22:57:18.213+02:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-28T10:44:49.261639+03:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "KZRXlJPM2Uq9+VNBlye/iQ=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "5. **GemStone Proxy** (subclass of {{gtClass:GtpoGtPhlowViewSpecification}}) — client-side proxy that fetches data from a remote GemStone specification via `proxyPerform:`."
						}
					]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
