				"string" : "## GemStone Proxy"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-28T11:33:08.080089+03:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-28T11:42:34.199396+03:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "yDIlt9+iQpaNt8A/rchmAA=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Local/remote views are tested using {{gtPragma:gtExample}} methods in an abstract examples class with Local and Remote subclasses. This ensures the same tests run against both paths.\n\n**Structure:**\n- **Abstract class** (e.g., {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowPictureViewAbstractExamples}}) — holds all examples and setup methods. Has `isAbstract` returning `true` on the class side.\n- **Local subclass** (e.g., {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowPictureViewLocalExamples}}) — {{gtMethod:name=createProtoView|label=#selector}} returns a view  instance of  type {{gtClass:GtPhlowProtoView}}\n- **Remote subclass** (e.g., {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowPictureViewRemoteExamples}}) — {{gtMethod:name=GtRemotePhlowPictureViewRemoteExamples>>#createProtoView|label=#selector}} returns a view instance of type {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowProtoView}}.\n\nThe polymorphic `createProtoView` is used by error examples that test the view construction path directly.\n\n**Test categories:**\n1. **Error examples** — test that computation errors produce {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowViewErrorData}} rather than propagating exceptions\n2. **Scripter examples** — use {{gtClass:BlScripter}} to test the full rendering pipeline in an inspector (tab clicks, element checks, error displays)\n3. **Declarative views examples** — test the specification/data pipeline via {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowDeclarativeViewsExamples}} subclasses (Local, Remote, ProxySimulation — not GemStone)\n4. **Alt+click examples** — test that alt+clicking a tab header opens the source definition in a new pager pane"
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
