				},
				"string" : "## Testing with Examples"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-07-27T22:57:18.252+02:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-07-31T11:13:15.691+02:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "SvebY+45ckmYxTbn7lyjtg=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "1. **View class** — subclass {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowLocalView}}. Add instance variables for computation blocks. Implement `asGtDeclarativeView` creating the specification with a data source.\n2. **Builder method** — add a method on both {{gtClass:GtPhlowProtoView}} and {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowProtoView}} that creates and returns the view instance (with `originalView:` and `definingMethod:` set).\n3. **Specification class** — subclass {{gtClass:GtPhlowViewSpecification}}. Implement `viewFor:` using {{gtMethod:GtPhlowExplicitView>>#declarativeStencil:}}, `asBasicViewDataForExport`, `fromJSONDictionary:`, `initializeFromInspector:`, `retrieveData`, `retrievePrimitiveData`.\n4. **Data source class** — subclass {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowDeclarativeViewDataSource}}. Implement `retrieveData` evaluating computations, wrapping errors.\n5. **View data class** — subclass {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowBasicViewData}}. Hold computed values, implement `asDictionaryForExport` and class-side `fromDictionary:`.\n6. **GemStone proxy** — subclass {{gtClass:GtpoGtPhlowViewSpecification}} in `GToolkit-GemStone-Pharo-Proxies`. Implement `retrieveData` calling `proxyPerform: #retrievePrimitiveData`.\n7. **Test object** — a class with a `gtView` method using the new view.\n8. **Examples** — abstract + Local/Remote subclasses testing error handling, scripter rendering, declarative pipeline, and alt+click definition browsing.\n9. **Declarative views example** — add a method in {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowDeclarativeViewsExamples}} testing the specification roundtrip (skip in GemStone subclass if no connection available)."
						}
					]
				},
